{"publicId":"0407286a-b720-44a0-8a1c-484c47fde515","title":"Box集成Nvidia Nemotron推出企业级内容检索系统","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","digest":"Box在开发者大会上宣布推出基于Nvidia Nemotron Embed项目的全新内容检索系统，预计将查询速度提升四倍，减少20%的错误率和90%的token使用量，目前该系统仅向Enterprise Advance客户开放，计划于明年早期逐步部署。\n\n该系统整合了Nvidia的开放权重嵌入模型，以提升自动化检索效率，并依赖现有元数据与权限控制框架。Nvidia VP Kari Briski在TechCrunch采访中强调，新系统将显著优化企业级应用（如法律条款检索）的实时响应能力。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T14:26:12.331Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统","latestReport":{"id":"yx5uxid5iuu4fa0gmn3xzh5nk"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fmcGIBFvf53s","title":"Box Content Retrieval系统上线","firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"yx5uxid5iuu4fa0gmn3xzh5nk","title":"Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统","summary":"Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统，通过嵌入向量技术提升企业级查询速度、准确性和成本效益。Nemotron在RTEB基准测试中表现突出，支持法律等专业场景的条款检索。系统依赖Box现有元数据与权限控制，需整合多技术实现。","source":{"name":"TechCrunch · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"yx5uxid5iuu4fa0gmn3xzh5nk","title":"Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统","summary":"Box发布基于Nvidia Nemotron的新内容检索系统，通过嵌入向量技术提升企业级查询速度、准确性和成本效益。Nemotron在RTEB基准测试中表现突出，支持法律等专业场景的条款检索。系统依赖Box现有元数据与权限控制，需整合多技术实现。","source":{"name":"TechCrunch · AI","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T21:00:00.000Z","heat":4.1,"participants":1},{"hour"